    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "I, you know, the short answer is I don't know. I think the race between the two of them is pretty close. And it depends a lot on the assumptions you make about turnout, who's going to turn out in a presidential primary in which there isn't really a contest for the Democratic nomination. There's a decreasing contest for the Republican nomination. But, look, I'm just honestly focused on running the best campaign I can. I do think people need to know that there are differences between the candidates, that I have a record of taking on the big fights and defending our democracy and getting things done that others don't have.",
