    "turn_text": "What are the big fights right now is over the border? There's a fight in the Senate among Republicans, some of whom want to do a deal with Democrats, some of whom do not. Donald Trump is saying don't do a deal with Democrats. If you're in the Senate, how do you get a deal done? How do you negotiate with those folks?",
